cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VRAVEN in research, cite the software release and the associated method paper when available."
title: "VRAVEN: Visual Reasoning and Activation Visualisation for Explainable Networks"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jeremiah
    given-names: Daniel
version: 0.10.1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/vraven-ai/vraven"
url: "https://vraven-ai.github.io/vraven/"
abstract: >-
  VRAVEN is an evidence-aware explainability and causal model-auditing toolkit
  for PyTorch. It traces internal representations, tests candidate mechanisms,
  and produces reproducible reports with explicit evidence boundaries.
keywords:
  - explainable artificial intelligence
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - causal decompilation
  - PyTorch
  - neural networks
